This ISO includes your custom configurations and dotfiles.

Installation steps:
  1. Connect to Wi-Fi (if needed): iwctl
  2. Run archinstall:
     archinstall --config /root/hifam-config/user_configuration.json \
                 --creds /root/hifam-config/user_credentials.json
     (Or just: archinstall for manual setup)
  3. After archinstall finishes, choose "No" to chroot/reboot
  4. Copy configs: ./copy-hifam-configs.sh
  5. Reboot: umount -R /mnt && reboot

Your configs will be in /usr/share/hifam after installation.

Documentation: /root/README.md  |  Configs: /root/hifam-config/

